{
    "title": "Carla Book Instantly Pay Later",
    "description": "Carla is a car rental app that compares global and local companies, including Hertz, Avis, Budget Car Rental, Dollar, Thrifty, Sixt, and Fox Rent a Car. \ud83d\ude97 featured on USA TODAY, Techcrunch, Boston Globe, Travel Pulse, and AutoRental News. Better than car sharing, you can get instant confirmation of your car rental booking and see true deals. \r\n\r\nGet Instant Confirmation. \r\n\r\nCompare All Brands and Book the Best Deals. Book your rental car and pay at your own pace after drop-off. \r\n \r\nSee all companies open now near you. Carla shows daily deals at companies that are near you.  \r\n \r\nHow can Carla help you to book your next trip? \ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f\r\n \r\n\u2022 4.5M+ rental cars selected annually. \ud83c\udfce\ufe0f\r\n\u2022 See all rental cars near you on the map. Check if the branches are open or not. \ud83d\udccd\r\n\u2022 Instant confirmation: Get your voucher email right after booking. \u2705\r\n\u2022 Under 25 fee waived: We're waiving under 25 at participating companies. 2\ufe0f\u20e35\ufe0f\u20e3\r\n\u2022 Book now and pay later in monthly payments with Affirm. \ud83d\udcb8\r\n\u2022 One-way rentals: Drop off at a different location. \u27a1\ufe0f\r\n\u2022 Skip the line at the counter \ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642\r\n\u2022 Last minute deals \ud83d\udd1c\r\n\u2022 24/7 customer service: Don't wait on the line for hours. We're here to help in seconds. \u2139\ufe0f\r\n\r\n<font color=\"#FF9033\"><b>What Users Say about Carla</b></font> \r\n\r\n\"Very easy to navigate, and the whole process was simple from start to finish and great selection and price.\"\r\n\r\n\"Easy setup and easy to find a rental. Customer service was great in helping with an issue I had. Ginny did a fantastic job making sure things were resolved. Highly recommend.\"\r\n\r\n\"Extremely flexible app; provides a multitude of options from locations to common car rental services like Hertz or car sharing apps like Turo. Can easily narrow down your preferred car using filters for car types and rental services. The ability to choose any time for both pick up and drop off helps with flexible scheduling, which could be a headache otherwise. The only gripe I have is not being able to filter through car make or manufacturer.\"\r\n \r\n<b>How to Rent a Car Avoiding Under 25 Fee</b>\r\n \r\nThe fee for those under 25 will be waived if you're renting from Surprise Suppliers on the Carla app. Enter your age before searching for cars on Carla and make a reservation with Surprise Suppliers. The supplier will be disclosed after your booking. The supplier will be one of the major car rental companies. There will be no young renters fee at the counter with an under 25 fee waiver unique to Carla. Make sure you book a rental car on Carla saying \"under 25 fee waived\" or \"no under 25 fee\".\r\n \r\nYou can rent a car at 20,000 locations worldwide from all major companies like Avis, Budget, Dollar, Fox, Sixt, Hertz, Thrifty, Europcar, and many local businesses. \r\n \r\n<font color=\"#FF9033\"><b>WHY USE CARLA?</b></font> \r\n<font color=\"#B15B1F\">\u2605</font> Rent a car you want. <b> Save up to $55 on your first road trip by using code \"NEWSTART\"</b>.\r\n<font color=\"#B15B1F\">\u2605</font> <b>No hidden costs or fees</b>.\r\n<font color=\"#B15B1F\">\u2605</font> <b>Hire a car</b> in a few seconds anywhere, anytime, from the airport, nearby, locally, or far away, for any occasion and budget.\r\n<font color=\"#B15B1F\">\u2605</font> <b>Discover great deals</b>.\r\n<font color=\"#B15B1F\">\u2605</font> All reservations in one app.\r\n \r\n <font color=\"#FF9033\"><b>TALK TO US! </b></font>\r\nContact us for feedback, suggestions, and issues \u2013 we'd love to help!\r\nYou can also find us on:\r\n<b>Website:</b>  https://www.rentcarla.com/\r\n<font color=\"#B15B1F\">\u2605</font>  <font color=\"#d42828\">Instagram: </font> https://www.instagram.com/rentcarla \r\n \r\n<b>Install NOW!</b>",
    "descriptionHTML": "Carla is a car rental app that compares global and local companies, including Hertz, Avis, Budget Car Rental, Dollar, Thrifty, Sixt, and Fox Rent a Car. \ud83d\ude97 featured on USA TODAY, Techcrunch, Boston Globe, Travel Pulse, and AutoRental News. Better than car sharing, you can get instant confirmation of your car rental booking and see true deals. <br><br>Get Instant Confirmation. <br><br>Compare All Brands and Book the Best Deals. Book your rental car and pay at your own pace after drop-off. <br> <br>See all companies open now near you. Carla shows daily deals at companies that are near you.  <br> <br>How can Carla help you to book your next trip? \ud83c\udfdd\ufe0f<br> <br>\u2022 4.5M+ rental cars selected annually. \ud83c\udfce\ufe0f<br>\u2022 See all rental cars near you on the map. Check if the branches are open or not. \ud83d\udccd<br>\u2022 Instant confirmation: Get your voucher email right after booking. \u2705<br>\u2022 Under 25 fee waived: We&#39;re waiving under 25 at participating companies. 2\ufe0f\u20e35\ufe0f\u20e3<br>\u2022 Book now and pay later in monthly payments with Affirm. \ud83d\udcb8<br>\u2022 One-way rentals: Drop off at a different location. \u27a1\ufe0f<br>\u2022 Skip the line at the counter \ud83c\udfc3\u200d\u2642<br>\u2022 Last minute deals \ud83d\udd1c<br>\u2022 24/7 customer service: Don&#39;t wait on the line for hours. We&#39;re here to help in seconds. \u2139\ufe0f<br><br><font color=\"#FF9033\"><b>What Users Say about Carla</b></font> <br><br>&quot;Very easy to navigate, and the whole process was simple from start to finish and great selection and price.&quot;<br><br>&quot;Easy setup and easy to find a rental. Customer service was great in helping with an issue I had. Ginny did a fantastic job making sure things were resolved. Highly recommend.&quot;<br><br>&quot;Extremely flexible app; provides a multitude of options from locations to common car rental services like Hertz or car sharing apps like Turo. Can easily narrow down your preferred car using filters for car types and rental services. The ability to choose any time for both pick up and drop off helps with flexible scheduling, which could be a headache otherwise. The only gripe I have is not being able to filter through car make or manufacturer.&quot;<br> <br><b>How to Rent a Car Avoiding Under 25 Fee</b><br> <br>The fee for those under 25 will be waived if you&#39;re renting from Surprise Suppliers on the Carla app. Enter your age before searching for cars on Carla and make a reservation with Surprise Suppliers. The supplier will be disclosed after your booking. The supplier will be one of the major car rental companies. There will be no young renters fee at the counter with an under 25 fee waiver unique to Carla. Make sure you book a rental car on Carla saying &quot;under 25 fee waived&quot; or &quot;no under 25 fee&quot;.<br> <br>You can rent a car at 20,000 locations worldwide from all major companies like Avis, Budget, Dollar, Fox, Sixt, Hertz, Thrifty, Europcar, and many local businesses. <br> <br><font color=\"#FF9033\"><b>WHY USE CARLA?</b></font> <br><font color=\"#B15B1F\">\u2605</font> Rent a car you want. <b> Save up to $55 on your first road trip by using code &quot;NEWSTART&quot;</b>.<br><font color=\"#B15B1F\">\u2605</font> <b>No hidden costs or fees</b>.<br><font color=\"#B15B1F\">\u2605</font> <b>Hire a car</b> in a few seconds anywhere, anytime, from the airport, nearby, locally, or far away, for any occasion and budget.<br><font color=\"#B15B1F\">\u2605</font> <b>Discover great deals</b>.<br><font color=\"#B15B1F\">\u2605</font> All reservations in one app.<br> <br> <font color=\"#FF9033\"><b>TALK TO US! </b></font><br>Contact us for feedback, suggestions, and issues \u2013 we&#39;d love to help!<br>You can also find us on:<br><b>Website:</b>  https://www.rentcarla.com/<br><font color=\"#B15B1F\">\u2605</font>  <font color=\"#d42828\">Instagram: </font> https://www.instagram.com/rentcarla <br> <br><b>Install NOW!</b>",
